@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Future after MVP. Provider, advanced Sprint/review, or untrusted execution requirement retained as deferred.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #17405A
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
hide footbox
autonumber
title AFTER MVP — SB-M12 — Current source/target and revision-related review
actor "Authorized participant" as U
participant "Pull request" as P
participant "Repository / current refs" as R
participant "Review context" as V
U -> P : Request one operation in intended source/target context
P -> R : Check current operation authority and revisions
alt Denied or invalid source / target
 R --> U : Rejection; no request/review/merge success
else Permitted current context
 alt Open pull request
  R --> P : Identified source / target revision context
  P --> U : Actual request creation result
 else Submit review / comment
  P -> V : Record attributed evaluated revision context
  V --> U : Actual review result
 else Request merge
  P -> V : Evaluate relevant review / check validity
  V --> P : Current eligible / stale / missing conditions
  P -> R : Evaluate current integration conditions
  alt Current authority and reviewed conditions eligible
   R -> R : Perform only the permitted current integration
   R --> U : Actual confirmed / failed / unknown integration outcome
  else Conflict, stale, missing or denied conditions
   R --> U : Rejected / conflicting; no integration success claim
  end
 end
end
note over P,R
These are separate user goals, not mandatory automatic steps.
No merge, tag or release grants production deployment approval.
end note
legend bottom
Logical domain interaction, not runtime execution evidence.
Detailed proposed guards/policies retain their primary status.
endlegend
@enduml
